{"version":1,"content":"<p>Xbox CEO Asha Sharma在品牌25周年之際發佈長篇信件，回顧微軟遊戲業務和Xbox四代主機的發展歷程，並確認第五代產品正在推進。她同時談及遊戲開發面臨的成本、資源和風險問題，以及Xbox未來的硬件與創作方向。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586248.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:58:01.947579+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:47:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:22.554259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:22.554259+00:00","content_hash":"c349c80b3e832fbc688c6c623a895f20175781a1169b08390aa1c227eca42032","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}